    "intro_narrative": "You awaken aboard the abandoned space station 'Helios-9', drifting aimlessly in the outer rim. The emergency lights cast long, eerie shadows down the metallic corridors, and the hum of the central AI has gone completely silent. A rogue containment protocol has sealed the blast doors, trapping you in the command sector. Oxygen levels are slowly dropping, and your only hope of survival is to manually override the station's mainframe and initiate a reboot sequence. However, the system's security architecture was designed to withstand a digital siege. You'll need to locate various scattered components, decipher corrupted logs, and piece together fractured data systems to unlock the core. Every tool and device you find must be used in a precise sequence to bypass the rigorous cryptographic safeguards. Time is running out. Can you restore power and escape before the station becomes your tomb?",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
  },
